# Ride the Shoopuf: "{5}{G}{G}: This enchantment becomes a 7/7 Beast creature in addition to its other types." "In addition"
# keeps every type it already has, creature types among them (CR 205.1b). Under Mycosynth Lattice the enchantment is an artifact
# too, so on turn 5 Donatello, Mutant Mechanic can target it: three +1/+1 counters, and it becomes a 0/0 Robot creature. Ride
# the Shoopuf's own ability, a later effect in layer 4 (CR 613.7a), adds Beast and keeps Robot: a Beast Robot, 7/7 with the
# counters on top (CR 613.4c), 10/10.

